# Nginx

Read `docs/nginx.md`. Use skill `firona-nginx`.

- Only public HTTP entry. Keep `/api` `/admin` `/static` on Django and `/` on the UI.
- Static `upstream` hosts (`backend`, `frontend`). Do not use `resolver 127.0.0.11`.
- Preserve `Host` and `X-Forwarded-*`.
- Prod: same locations; swap `/` to Vue `dist` + TLS. Do not publish backend/frontend ports.
